# Cloudflare Pages response headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/).
# The site draws this art on a canvas, which needs CORS, and may keep a file
# for a day: corrected art shows up within that, and a stale copy is still
# shown while the new one is fetched.
/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
